   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "There's an old fable. A scorpion asks a frog to carry it across a river. The frog says, you'll sting me. The scorpion says, why would I? We'd both drown."
    },
    {
     "text": "Halfway across, it stings. As they sink, the frog asks why. And the scorpion says: it's my nature."
    }
   ]
